  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Meeting of companies working with Centre for the Promotion of Imports from developing countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A closing ceremony will be held by the Netherlands embassy in Lima, Peru to mark the end of CBI&apos;s country programme in Peru, which spanned from 2014 to 2018, and the closure of CBI&apos;s operations in Peru after nearly 40 years.The guests invited to the meeting will include representatives of the participating companies, partners, and local experts involved in the last country programme.</narrative>
  </description>
